# hardware run: stress build, PATTERN=1 VC_MODE=2, ECC_INJECT_SBE
# board: Arty A7-100T (xc7a100t), Digilent 210319C088F2A
# date: 2026-09-10
# MARK_DEBUG 1104 nets -> 5 ILA cores / 55 probes / 1100 bits
#
# purpose: prove the ECC alarm path on silicon. Until now the board counters
# read 0, but a disconnected flag also reads 0. ECC_INJECT_SBE flips one bit of
# every codeword entering the RAM, so single_err must fire on every node.

พบ 4 agent: agent_00, agent_01, agent_10, agent_11

